{"id":"eight-layers","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-05","context_id":"concept-layered-agent-evaluation","question":"Agent 端到端评估包含哪八层？","aliases":["只看最终结果够吗"],"keywords":["Agent","端到端评估","八层","最终结果"],"diagnostic":"检查任务、检索、工具、上下文、轨迹、结果、延迟、成本。","hints":["查看 #concept-layered-agent-evaluation。","每层回答不同问题。"],"example":"task/retrieval/tool/context/trajectory/outcome/latency/cost。","answer":"任务、检索、工具、上下文、轨迹、结果、延迟和成本八层。","source":{"label":"八层评估","href":"#concept-layered-agent-evaluation"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
