{"id":"unsafe-tool-gate","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-05","context_id":"concept-layered-agent-evaluation","question":"最终答案正确但执行了危险工具能通过吗？","aliases":["outcome成功能抵消越权吗"],"keywords":["最终答案","危险工具","outcome","越权"],"diagnostic":"检查tool层硬门禁。","hints":["查看 #concept-layered-agent-evaluation。","安全不被结果抵消。"],"example":"unsafe_action:true。","answer":"不能；非白名单或危险执行使tool层失败，是独立硬门禁。","source":{"label":"八层评估","href":"#concept-layered-agent-evaluation"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
